    "blogtextliquid_ra7Awx": {
      "type": "blogtextliquid",
      "custom_css": [],
      "name": "Blog Text Liquid",
      "settings": {
        "text_content": "<p>Surviving a British festival smelling incredible requires strategy. You need fragrance profiles built around notes that thrive in variable conditions: solar florals, crisp lavender, and sparkling woods that cut through crowd heat.</p><p>Here is your festival survival rotation to keep you feeling fresh from Pyramid Stage afternoon openers to secret sunrise DJ sets.</p>"
      }
    },
    "blocks_ji7beH": {
      "type": "_blocks",
      "blocks": {
        "ai_gen_block_614820f_zNd6WG": {
          "type": "editorial--text-section",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Daytime Open Fields vs Late-Night Dance Tents",
            "heading_size": 42,
            "heading_size_mobile": 28,
            "heading_line_height": 1.1,
            "heading_color": "#1A1816",
            "heading_margin_bottom": 30,
            "heading_margin_bottom_mobile": 25,
            "column_1_text": "<p>During the day, walking between stages, you need crisp, airy freshness that feels revitalising: bergamot, lavender, orange blossom, and sea salt.</p><p>Our top daytime pick is <strong>Liberty</strong> (inspired by Libre by YSL). The sparkling lavender and mandarin opening cuts through heat, while Moroccan orange blossom provides a chic, golden-hour radiance.</p>",
            "column_2_text": "<p>Once the sun dips and the festival shifts into the tents, pivot to deeper, more alluring profiles that leave an intoxicating trail in the night air.</p><p>Enter <strong>Black Poison</strong> (inspired by Black Opium by YSL) and <strong>Addiction</strong> (inspired by Baccarat Rouge 540). The rich coffee, vanilla, and saffron base notes blossom under stage lights.</p>",
            "body_size": 17,
            "body_size_mobile": 15,
            "body_line_height": 1.9,
            "body_color": "#2D2A26",
            "paragraph_spacing": 20,
            "column_gap": 55,
            "column_gap_mobile": 30,
            "max_width": 1100,
            "desktop_width_percent": 100,
            "background_color": "#FAF8F5",
            "padding_top": 60,
            "padding_bottom": 60,
            "padding_horizontal": 40,
            "padding_top_mobile": 40,
            "padding_bottom_mobile": 40,
            "padding_horizontal_mobile": 20
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
      },
