      "settings": {}
    },
    "1778690749e24fd023": {
      "type": "_blocks",
      "blocks": {
        "ai_gen_block_fb81b45_9nTtAA": {
          "type": "editorial--content",
          "settings": {
            "desktop_width_percent": 100,
            "max_width": 1100,
            "section_padding": 60,
            "background_color": "#FAF8F5",
            "heading": "<p>Festival essentials: Fate & Feminine Fancy</p>",
            "heading_size": 42,
            "heading_color": "#1A1816",
            "heading_spacing": 25,
            "box_color": "#1C1917",
            "box_radius": 15,
            "box_padding": 45,
            "box_spacing": 35,
            "box_paragraph_1": "<p>Day Two is the marathon. You need a fragrance that carries you effortlessly without requiring constant reapplication.</p><p><strong>Fate</strong> (inspired by Chance EDP by Chanel) is the ultimate festival secret weapon. With pink pepper, jasmine, and amber patchouli, it has just enough spice to be interesting and enough crisp floral elegance to stay fresh.</p><p>When the midnight afterparty rolls around, a single spritz of <strong>Feminine Fancy</strong> (inspired by Good Girl by Carolina Herrera) on your collar delivers roasted tonka and cocoa depth that lasts until breakfast.</p>",
            "box_paragraph_2": "",
            "box_paragraph_3": "",
            "box_text_color": "#F5EFE6",
            "box_text_size": 17,
            "box_text_line_height": 1.9,
            "paragraph_spacing": 20,
            "subheading": "<p>Packing smart: metallic pocket atomizers</p>",
            "subheading_size": 42,
            "subheading_color": "#1A1816",
            "subheading_spacing": 40,
            "bottom_text": "<p>Never bring full glass bottles into festival campsites where they can break in bags. Decant into sleek, metallic pocket atomizers that fit in your jacket or bumbag.</p><p>They are virtually indestructible and allow quick, refreshing top-ups between acts.</p>",
            "bottom_text_size": 17,
            "bottom_text_color": "#2D2A26",
            "bottom_text_line_height": 1.9
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "ai_gen_block_fb81b45_9nTtAA"
      ],
      "settings": {}
    },
